=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Ratihb} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (J-12 Shararat Teahouse) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
** **(Optional)** Speak to him again to start the quest {q:The Die is Cast|The Die is Cast|The Die is Cast}. It requires passing through the same key-locked area as this quest.
* Speak to {n:Mafwahb} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (L-9 Palace Door) for a cutscene.
* Go to {z:Arrapago Reef} Map 1.
** The {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Arrapago Reef} is the fastest way.
*** If you go this way, make sure to zone out to {z:Caedarva Mire} map 1 (I-6), walk south to (I-7), and inspect the ??? west of the southern pool of water to get a {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219}. You can collect this key here once per game day.
*** Afterwards, go back north to return to {z:Arrapago Reef} map 1.
** If you need to walk:
*** Take the north exit from {z:Nashmau} to {z:Caedarva Mire} map 1.
*** Go to {z:Caedarva Mire} (I-7) and inspect the ??? west of the southern pool of water to get a {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219}. You can collect this key here once per game day.
*** Continue north to {z:Caedarva Mire} (I-6) and enter {z:Arrapago Reef} map 1.
* Ensure you have a {@i:Lamian Fang Key|2219} {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219}. You can farm it as a drop in {z:Arrapago Reef}, but that's not recommended. It's better that you grab the free one mentioned earlier.
** Lamian Fang Keys drop from {p:Lamiae|Category:Lamiae} and {p:Draugers|Category:Skeleton} in the area.
*** **Enemies that can drop the key have approx ~16 minute repop window, so consider this before setting out. There are a limited number of potential opponents (5) between the zone-line and the gate before the quest marker.**
* Use the Lamian Fang Key on the Iron Gate at {z:Arrapago Reef} map 1 (J-10), then go immediately west on the small map to another Iron Gate. (This second Iron Gate is unlocked, as you are opening it from behind.)
* Click on the **???** (NOT the shining spot labeled "-") at the North East corner of (H-10) for a cutscene. It's located on a ship, on a raised wooden platform.
** It's possible to get a different cutscene that starts with Zweeha upon clicking the **???**. Clicking the **???** may also direct you to investigate a pier to the northwest. If this happens, keep clicking until you get the correct cutscene that starts with Wasuhd and Mutihb before proceeding to the next step.
* Enter {z:Talacca Cove} from {z:Caedarva Mire} (E-9) Map 1. This area is outside of {z:Nashmau}'s west exit.
** {p:Home Point} #1 in {z:Caedarva Mire} puts you immediately right at the zoning point, just zone into the Cove.
* Go around the left side of the lake in the large room until you find a **???** spot and examine it for a cutscene and the key item {@k} {k:Forgotten hexagun}.
** The ??? is not next to the water, it is at the NW corner, on a rock, close to the tunnel entrance going West.
* Travel west into the tunnel entrance, then North to find the Rock Slab (follow the tunnel, you can't go wrong), examine the slab for a cutscene that ends the quest to receive your reward.

